  "description": "These pallet fork extensions fit forks up to 4.5 inch wide; Just slide the extensions onto your current pallet forks and you are all set! These pallet forks won’t strain your machinery, allowing you to lift larger objects than you would normally be able to lift with your forklift .\nFeatures\nSPECIFICALLY\nDESIGNED FOR 4.5\" FORKLIFTS: These pallet fork extensions fit forks up\nto 4.5 inch wide; Just slide the extensions onto your current pallet\nforks and you are all set! These pallet forks won’t strain your\nmachinery, allowing you to lift larger objects than you would normally\nbe able to lift with your forklift\nDURABLE ALLOY STEEL: These fork extensions are made from high tensile\nsteel for exceptional strength and durability; Providing extra\nprotection and reinforcement to your equipment. Because of their\nheavy-duty steel construction, these extensions won’t rust or corrode,\nso you can enjoy them for years to come!\nRETAINING STRAP DESIGN: To maximize safety, the forklift extensions are\nequipped with steel retaining strap to keep the extensions in place, so\nyou do not need to worry about them slipping off!\nHIGH LIFTING CAPACITY: The pallet fork extensions provide you with the\nextra support to lift long or large objects and provide a simple, but\neffective method of handling the occasional long and awkward load. Trust\nthese 92 inch pallet fork extensions to help you complete the task!\nEFFORTLESS INSTALLATION: This pallet fork extensions can be easily\ninstalled by one person without any tools required; And they can be used\nto move large and heavy loads or debris in construction sites,\nwarehouses, building sites and farms",
